      "narration": "Look at the numbers we produced: one, two, three, five, eight. That's the Fibonacci sequence, and climbing stairs is Fibonacci wearing a hat. A surprising number of dynamic programming problems turn out to be a famous sequence in disguise, and spotting that's often faster than deriving anything. If you write out the first few answers by hand and the pattern looks familiar, trust it and check it.",
